# PROSEMA agent rules

Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) at the start of substantive tasks.

- Work on **`dev-dk`** on this machine unless `PROSEMA_DEV_BRANCH` or primary-operator detection says **`dev`**. Use `./scripts/checkout_work_branch.sh` before editing.
- Never commit to **`main`** directly. Production deploy = squash-merge via `./release.sh --push`.
- Run **`pytest`** before commit; warn the user if the change touches many modules, DB migrations, weclapp writes, or assistant behaviour — those need Chris’s supervision.
- weclapp live writes: follow [`docs/artikel-registrierung.md`](../../docs/artikel-registrierung.md) (test article `999.999` unless explicitly approved).
- Do not commit `.env` or secrets.
